#: ../../catalog_intake.md:1 05c6caf810a54f7ca132c4242ae99021
msgid "Catalog intake: receiving batches to Airtable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:3 515a50c4e9fc493a91de60dbbbf741dd
msgid ""
"The Airtable side of the product intake workflow run by `app.rewake.fr`. "
"Operations register arriving products in the app (receiving batches, "
"product groups); the app pushes each group to Airtable as a **draft** "
"once it has the minimum fields, then a reviewer **validates** it. The app"
" owns the workflow state; the API only writes Airtable. Code: "
"`api/services/catalog_sync.py`, `api/services/catalog_lookup.py`, "
"`api/domain/intake.py`, `api/routes/internal/catalog/` (how the tables "
"fit together: [Catalog model](catalog_model.md))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:12 c93b6b392bf449318a141a9bd331d697
msgid ""
"All routes are under `/internal/catalog`, with `APP_TOKEN` + "
"`app.rewake.fr` origin (like other internal routes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:15 1a23ed0f85c241c3b28d65f9c2d10a88
msgid "Endpoints"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md fce70ebb826f46119a8a02231cc3754a
msgid "Route"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 9115ec82e4aa48eea335668cf48e8c28
msgid "Does"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 029da608c55248f1a0276e98f297a8bf
msgid "`GET /options`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md f437685c384c4063ae2b7ecce1cacacf
msgid ""
"Brands, equipment types (with family), specification keys (with their "
"`kind`), expected specs per family, Unit condition choices (`Etat "
"esthétique`, `État fonctionnel`). Cached 10 min; `?refresh=true` reloads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 55aff8e6bf334130a37f38ac47117cc7
msgid "`POST /match`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 81e6ddb8f2ea43c2966cb55ab729772b
msgid ""
"Existing Models matching brand + model, with their Variations, through "
"the catalog search below (Airtable formula lookup if the index is "
"unavailable). A suggestion: a human picks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 54e24b276a10476d82f36619b8ea7bdf
msgid "`GET /airtable-links`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 8d16e06d4b4545c081e9a599beb95e09
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`base_id` and the table ids of Model, Variation and Units "
"(`tables.model`, `.variation`, `.unit`), so the app can open a record at "
"`https://airtable.com/{base}/{table}/{record}` (schema cached)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 2c26e7f1bc4848db83767570ecf1791d
msgid "`POST /search`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 8b1cda32a967448f89c68ae8fb6d0b5e
msgid ""
"Catalog search for the app: `results` for `q` (every word must match, "
"partial words, any order, most relevant first; `limit` 10, max 30) and, "
"separately, `suggestions` (default 3, max 10) from the item's `identity` "
"(brand, model, serial, product_hint, label_text). 503 when the catalog "
"index is unavailable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 0597247f5f7845319aaf7f84ed199dbb
msgid "`POST /units/sync`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 52addfd3a39a424195174db7b65ec120
msgid ""
"Create or complete the Unit of one received item, as soon as operations "
"finish it (see \"Units of received items\" below)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md b9b994d213934097968e786141688cb1
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /units/{id}/photos`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md fe978548d73f4618a92d60e3ac751a52
msgid ""
"Add one of the operations' photos to the Unit's `Photos interne` "
"(`image_b64`, `content_type` JPEG/PNG/WebP, `filename` "
"`rw-<photo>-<kind>.<ext>`; 5 MB max); idempotent by file name → "
"`attachment_id`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 8942373be85f43b78038c1649f10fde7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /units/{id}/photos/remove`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 61132ceac987476887ca61e1235e8230
msgid ""
"Remove these attachments (`attachment_ids`, 100 max), keep every other "
"one → `removed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md e93f6666a2d44e69a14aa951ef85564f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /units/{id}/remove`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md b6ba1de87b1e42b4b01ca45b86fcb04e
msgid ""
"Delete a Unit the app created. **409 `unit_locked`** once engaged "
"commercially; already gone: 200."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md f5c45d3d9740482bab07cb40a105bce6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /units/{id}/restore`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 0d9a6ac931534415abe455cd0c235d63
msgid ""
"Put a pre-created reprise Unit's `fields` (snapshot) back; `restored: "
"false` if it no longer exists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 806972dca347459ab6318f4674026bfc
msgid "`POST /groups/push`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 9cbf1fe99a134bba85f0db272474164d
msgid ""
"Create or update a group: Model → Variation(s) → Specification(s) → "
"Unit(s)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 92c2560973d54c81bd204553fb4993b6
msgid "`POST /groups/validate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md c6f84dab8104455d9d95e6ada2a58e0f
msgid ""
"`Statut validation Variation = Validé` on the group's `variation_ids`; "
"`conversions` turn an existing default Variation into a variant (axis "
"spec created, `is_variant = Oui`). **409 "
"`shopify_confirmation_required`** when converting on a Model on Shopify "
"without `confirm_shopify`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md d4671f17943a43409f1aae9e24c9c782
msgid "`POST /groups/unvalidate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ad30e1b51ec04690bae0d3b92762e676
msgid ""
"Back to `À valider`. **409 `on_shopify`** if the Model has a `ShopifyID` "
"or an `Annonces Shopify` record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ef9dccca7e3844aab377aed98086eed3
msgid "`POST /groups/cancel`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md a195a2b085ab48e4949f2f51e2091d5b
msgid ""
"Delete what the group created (the Model only if `model_created`), give "
"pre-created reprise Units their snapshot back (`restore_units`) and "
"remove its accessory links (`compat_links`). **409 `on_shopify`** / "
"**`unit_locked`**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 03394b5833704a3389d20752763a6e2d
msgid "`POST /relationships/accessory`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 2a7eeced94e34dffb8e3dde3bdb35ff5
msgid ""
"Add an accessory Model to a host's `Compatibilité` row (`Machine fille`),"
" creating the row if needed, and tick the accessory's `is_accessory`; "
"idempotent. **409 `self_link`** for a Model as its own accessory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 09cb490b0adf400694bc86db0079cc22
msgid "`POST /relationships/accessory/remove`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md a2b3e7c5ec1749c391500a1dfcb020df
msgid "Remove it again (`removed`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 9eadff6d58934548b1da26ddc7c99345
msgid "`GET /reprises?q=`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 01777f62408e4d75855bf8fc32b374df
msgid ""
"`Opération reprise` records to receive: `Statut logistique = Appareils "
"reçus` (set by the operations team when the equipment arrives) and "
"`Statut opérationnel` not `Inventaire terminé`, newest first (100 max); "
"`q` filters on the name and the seller company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 5cba4ff49e0644deb017a2a7f6acd5dc
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /reprises/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ec772aaf604447969c75523b98f60b54
msgid ""
"The operation, its pre-created Units (each with the matched equipment row"
" of its proposition) and unmatched equipment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md cb2dea7c698e4750ae17b31ace5f2380
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /units/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md e5c061b654ce46a6be55a23e97fe9060
msgid ""
"A Unit's catalog fields, with the `snapshot` to restore if the item is "
"removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 070bd9dc0fb142e2b57dc8e4091a579d
msgid "`POST /units/photos`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 962cba1be45546b5820c0264e8edb38c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`Photos client` (attachments on the Unit) of several Units, `{ids}` (200 "
"max) → `{photos: {id: [{url, thumbnail, name}]}}`, images only, one "
"Airtable call per 50 ids. Links expire after a few hours: the app caches "
"them briefly, never stores them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 365b211c30af45a8b32376895bc2ec8d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /variations/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 8f32419632034f7d876ebf633f4ba79e
msgid ""
"A Variation's name, `model_id`, `is_variant` and status (Référence "
"variant checks), its Model's brand, reference and type (`brand`, "
"`modele`, `type`: the item's known identity) and known `dimensions` (to "
"pre-fill measurements)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 48d8cfda7d884e888c9265cd22f55e11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /reprises/{id}/received`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ce7c5323e42a4877835babb014a7f605
msgid ""
"Operation `Statut logistique = Appareils reçus` (+ `Date de réception` if"
" empty); returns the previous values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 28a772dcbe6641678e63a6e3cb6c12a4
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /reprises/{id}/received/undo`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ee044f6fffae46e5bdb7ee99c056ea7b
msgid ""
"Put the previous values back (409 `operation_changed` if the status moved"
" meanwhile)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 933cf69ad8fe4b11b0b926f90b6f8973
msgid "`POST /ocr`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 872fbc4e50e34f8f99a3d41fd9a73932
msgid ""
"Queue a label photo (`image_b64`, `content_type`; 8 MB max) for OCR; "
"returns `job_id`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 1e025c19c8ab4752ab24ce4c78287a2c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /ocr/{job_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 58d82fb8e213438a8e59b085b4a71ee5
msgid ""
"`queued` / `running` / `done` (+ `result`: `lines`, `fields`) / `failed` "
"(+ `error`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md f8d510bf11b74ba1a159a8a179214c2d
msgid "`POST /suggest-reference`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 9f010dbb49254b4da3e3f526b2339ec9
msgid ""
"Référence variant of a received item (`brand`, `model`, `serial`, "
"`product_hint`, `label_text`, `photos_text`, up to 4 `images`): existing "
"Variations first (catalog index ranking, then the AI decides within the "
"shortlist, with confidences), else a new reference mapped to the closest "
"existing brands / models / types (a brand not in Airtable is flagged "
"`new`). Heuristic ranking alone when the AI is off or unavailable "
"(`ai_error`). The AI also reads the serial number (`read.serial`). "
"Without a confident match, a second pass with `photos_text` (OCR of the "
"other photos) when the `ocr_fallback` setting is on (`fallback_used`). "
"503 when the catalog is unavailable. See \"Reference suggestion\" below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md b1652c09c3b84a6782e4399e351d883a
msgid "`POST /brands`, `POST /types`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 018149c54f0244a9bddba5d5575712dd
msgid ""
"Create a brand / equipment type the operator confirmed as new (idempotent"
" by normalized name: an existing one comes back with `created: false`; a "
"type's optional `famille` must be an existing family name, else 400)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md eb02868cbc984315b58342a624dd297e
msgid "`POST /spec-types`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md c03dd5a1a65a4a318a9aa3f5868cf08b
msgid ""
"Create a specification key (variant axis) the operator confirmed as new, "
"with its `kind` (`Numérique` default, `Boolean`, `Text`); idempotent by "
"normalized name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md c8f8a29101494aff9c5a2a74d93e3ef5
msgid "`POST /research`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 611cb06763124b28a8bff34b3e6e74e7
msgid ""
"Queue the AI research of one product identity (`brand`, `model`, "
"`product_hint`, `serial_example`, `label_text`; 422 without `model`, "
"`product_hint` or `label_text`). Refused by the AI settings: **503 "
"`not_configured`** (no AI provider has a key), **409 `disabled`**, **429 "
"`daily_limit`** / **`budget`**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 125ef5900e70493ea1863241cf17529d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /research/{job_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ae7b2a804dbe4e7dba72fb513ed0b0d5
msgid "Same states as OCR; `result` is the proposal below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 36481d70abe3499cb9c6af381d8c8ea5
msgid "`GET /review-queue`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 35b847bc7de349509f01d7e580cd3e59
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Models to verify for the site, most urgent first (see \"Commercial "
"review\" below); `?refresh=true` rebuilds now. `{models, age_seconds}`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md f1db9f20246943aba46bb3196eeeb11e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /models/{id}/verify`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md aebbb2fd850c41b5a0038cb946721310
msgid ""
"`Vérification pour site` checked, its Variations `Statut verification = "
"Vérifié` (and `Validé` when still `À valider`: `validated_variations`). "
"**409 `shopify_decision_required`** while `to_sell_on_shopify` is empty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 0f5541cc5f584edc86afa96e696abd11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /models/{id}/unverify`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md c50402d47d66425a85caec5613b3df59
msgid ""
"Back to review: unchecked, Variations `Non vérifié` (a `Validé` status "
"stays)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 396b1dd202984c6ca6b054c051012a49
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /models/{id}/sheet`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md a50764dc5da543268193c16aca710eb7
msgid ""
"A Model's full sheet for the commercial review (`?variation_id=` adds "
"that Variation's status, unit count and specifications, the variant's own"
" first; `?all_variations=true` adds `variation_list`: every Variation "
"with its statuses, specifications and Units in stock with their `Photos "
"interne`): identity, editable `fields`, `photos` (Photo neuve), "
"`documents` (Documentation, Manuel Operateur, Manuel de service), "
"`verified`, Shopify / accessory / compatibility flags. Attachment links "
"expire: never stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md e12ce4c74dab4a85a65a7b200edc76a5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /models/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ca5087f46b6448838100b0f95f532d3c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Correct the Model: `{changes, expected}` with keys `short_description`, "
"`long_description`, `longueur_mm`, `hauteur_mm`, `profondeur_mm`, "
"`poids_kg`, `prix_neuf_ht`, `dimension_exacte`, `poids_estime`, "
"`notice_introuvable`, `to_sell_on_shopify` (`Oui` / `Non`). **409 "
"`changed_in_airtable`** when Airtable no longer holds `expected` (nothing"
" written); 422 for a bad value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md b03db8655b404f009fc5e7ee014ff7a7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /models/{id}/pdf`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 4f7268610e6646e4986996009d340fce
msgid ""
"The sales team's PDF of the model (`pdf_b64`, `filename`, `attach`, "
"default true; 10 MB max, 422 if not a PDF): added to `Documentation` and "
"read by the AI → the proposed sheet (see \"Commercial review\"). "
"Synchronous (1-2 min). AI refusals as for `/research` (503 / 409 / 429); "
"**502** when no AI model answered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md ef85e63cffba4c86a3cd186bc8d64273
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /models/{id}/variants`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md cab05701025a4935aed5b63141796e76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Create a proposed variant: `{axis, specs, convert_variation_id?}` (each "
"`{spec_type_id, valeur, unite}`) → `{variation_id, created}`. **409 "
"`on_shopify`** / **`already_variant`** when converting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 90ae404f48d341308f4bd127054f9fbb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /variations/{id}/specs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 7a8a81e0a76e4ab093c4d560a4215446
msgid "Add a specification (`spec_type_id`, `valeur`, `unite`) to a Variation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md fd8f43d1bfdb49e8b6eb4bbd92716ab3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /specs/{id}`, `DELETE /specs/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md a94647ca666448cb897aff2be56368bc
msgid ""
"Change a specification's `valeur` / `unite` (value required, 200 "
"characters max; 422 otherwise), or remove it (**409 `variant_axis`** for "
"the spec that tells a variant apart)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md d5953e680ab7411b90cbf6a0639a8437
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /models/{id}/documents`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 708a6e16fc7c414db71471a144edb3b5
msgid ""
"Add a PDF by URL (`field`, `url`, optional `filename`) to "
"`documentation`, `manuel_operateur` or `manuel_service` (others kept, "
"same file name not added twice; a document in the first two clears « "
"Notice Introuvable »). The link is checked first: 422 unless it is a "
"reachable PDF on a public host."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 36d98f2caa314bd0902413739418d083
msgid "`POST /describe`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md df5ab0c632ae49819a76e221ac7777fc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"AI rewrite of a product's descriptions (`name`, `brand`, `model`, `type`,"
" `famille`, current texts, `specs`, optional `instruction`; 422 without "
"`name` or `model`) → `short_description`, `long_description`, `issues` "
"(e.g. the current text describes another product), `ai_call_id`, "
"`ai_model`. A proposal: nothing written. AI refusals and 502 as for "
"`/models/{id}/pdf`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md 5a9abd1100114229ae943f04436c42d6
msgid "`POST /documents/search`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md f803424101ac4196a2894e925747528c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Queue the AI web search of a model's PDF documents (same identity; AI "
"refusals as for `/research`); `GET /documents/search/{job_id}` → "
"`documents` (`url`, `title`, `kind`, `language`, `covers`, `filename`, "
"`size`), each checked to be a reachable PDF (`rejected` counts the "
"others), and `notes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:61 35a57220a22648f59ebdb66a7facdd1d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Refusals are `409` with `detail = {\"code\", \"message\", ...}`; the app "
"shows the message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:64 edec63ed6d9e4275aae6105de68a2c20
msgid "Push"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:66 8e55eddae68b4b38b475d12ecde3d7b1
msgid ""
"Every entity in the request has a `ref`, a stable app-side id (`model`, "
"`variation:12`, `spec:40`, `unit:7`). The response maps each ref to its "
"Airtable record id (`ids`) and returns the fields written per record "
"(`written`), which the app sends back as `baseline` on the next push."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:71 e5f82bceb3cb4d6c969b942d93fea4da
msgid ""
"**Created records**: Variations start as `À valider`. A variant Variation"
" needs an `axis` spec: it is created with both `Variation associée` and "
"`Spec_variant`, which makes it the Variation's `Variant_name` "
"(`Variant_value` is a lookup of its `valeur`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:75 7f686afb420b413bbb6fddb9fcdb30ef
msgid ""
"**Selected records** (`created_by_group: false`): an existing Model or "
"Variation is linked to, never edited."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:77 46f07b540264428b99933fab06bb4335
msgid ""
"**Refusals** (409): `incomplete_model` (a created Model needs name, brand"
" and type), `missing_model_id` / `missing_variation_id` (a selected "
"record without its id), `missing_variant_axis`, `unknown_variation` (a "
"Unit pointing to a Variation absent from the group)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:81 cf45ca167038434aa4219e31cbe7d55d
msgid ""
"**No duplicates on retry**: each created record id is stored in Redis "
"(`api:catalog:refs:<idempotency_key>`, 90 days) as soon as Airtable "
"returns it. The `idempotency_key` must be stable per product group. A "
"push that fails midway answers `502` with the `ids` created so far; "
"sending the same push again resumes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:86 2fcfa8bedd704051a873df55c37930e9
msgid ""
"**Conflicts**: for a record with a `baseline`, the current Airtable "
"values are compared first. A field changed in Airtable since the last "
"push (and not to the value the app wants) makes the record a conflict: it"
" is not written, and the response has `status: \"conflict\"` with the "
"differences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:90 6a0d48a4f33440899ac0bd070ae8c53b
msgid ""
"**Removed records** the group created earlier and no longer has: "
"`removed_unit_ids` (refused if the Unit is engaged commercially: status "
"Vendu/Commandé/Réservé/En enchères, or linked to a Vente, Devis or Vente "
"aux enchères), `removed_spec_ids`, `removed_variation_ids` (refused, "
"`variation_has_units`, if the Variation still has Units after this push "
"re-linked them)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_intake.md:96 48d295ddbd994ae0ad7463faf7dfdd12
msgid ""
"**Restored Units** (`restored_units`): pre-created reprise Units given "
"their snapshot back."
msgstr ""

