"Airtable's content API (`content.airtable.com/.../uploadAttachment`, "
"base64, 5 MB max), named `rw-<photo id>-<kind>.<ext>`: a retry finds the "
"attachment by that name instead of adding it twice. Removing photos keeps"
" every attachment added by people. A removed item's Unit is deleted "
"(`/units/{id}/remove`, refused once engaged commercially) or, for a pre-"
