#: ../../catalog_intake.md:137 3b59a18c0af94988b4f4efc0135e6af6
msgid ""
"Equipment rows (`Équipements liés aux propositions de reprises`) of the "
"linked `Propositions de reprises` record have no link to the Units: they "
"are matched by normalized serial number (exact first, then one containing"
" the other, 5+ characters), one to one. When exactly one Unit and one row"
